WEBVTT

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:07.180
My hands are so cold.

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:08.150
Oh, hush.

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:10.260
It wasn't even that much water work.

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:14.640
<i>I didn't think I'd have to 
put up with her for so long.</i>

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:16.690
<i>Sheesh...</i>

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:35.860
Your face is so big, the bucket doesn't fit!

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:39.860
Get over here, you two!

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:41.380
Sorry!

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:51.370
She's so terrible.

00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:04.510
<i>Come to think of it, she's been 
terrible ever since we met.</i>

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:36.050
<b>Konohana Kitan</b>

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:41.050
<b>Episode 3 
Waiting Lovesick</b>

00:02:43.820 --> 00:02:45.260
I can't take it anymore!

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:48.330
Please switch my partner 
out with Satsuki-neesama!

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:50.920
I don't know.

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:54.780
It wouldn't be fair if I put 
two capable people together.

00:02:55.720 --> 00:02:57.200
<i>Capable?</i>

00:02:57.430 --> 00:03:00.050
Wh-Why, thank you.

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:04.020
I certainly wouldn't want to cause 
trouble for our guests, but...

00:03:04.020 --> 00:03:05.260
<i>Too easy.</i>

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:06.360
Well...

00:03:06.550 --> 00:03:09.110
I could try pairing you up with Yuzu.

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:13.120
N-Nacchan is fine, thanks.

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:13.720
Okay.

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:21.410
Man, another exhausting day.

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:24.710
You got me tired out 
before work even started.

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:27.010
But you were laughing too, Ren.

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:28.680
I was not.

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:30.410
What happened?

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:32.270
Okay, listen to this!

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:33.200
Ren was like...

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:34.870
It's not my fault!

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:38.280
So then, the bucket fell right on Okami's head!

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:43.520
Oh, no, Yun-tan! 
Your butt has split into two!

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:45.570
What? Really?

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:48.290
Don't fall for such an old prank, Yuzu.

00:03:48.810 --> 00:03:49.800
I'm serious.

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:51.530
Look, straight down the middle!

00:03:50.190 --> 00:03:51.530
<i>What an idiot.</i>

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:54.830
Jeez, you're so cute.

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:57.420
Don't tease me!

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:58.690
<i>She's always acting like a moron.</i>

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:58.690
Sorry about that.

00:04:12.590 --> 00:04:14.010
Is someone there?

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:23.900
N-No! Stay away!

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:25.620
You're so dirty.

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:27.610
You can't go home like that.

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:39.870
<i>Oh, it's a girl.</i>

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:45.210
<i>She had striking, long limbs, and she looked 
like she could have been a boy or a girl.</i>

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:46.220
<i>She said...</i>

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:47.850
Face the other way.

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:50.560
I'll wash you down.

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:57.260
Stay still.

00:04:59.510 --> 00:05:02.510
So you got bullied by a boy, huh?

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:04.090
Uh-huh.

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:11.550
<i>She was more beautiful than 
any creature I'd ever seen.</i>

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:23.130
<i>Though that impression was mistaken...</i>

00:05:29.280 --> 00:05:31.850
Safe travels.

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:34.390
Yuzu-chan.

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:35.140
Yes!

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:36.480
Natsume, over here.

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:37.390
Coming.

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:38.140
It's coming undone.

00:05:38.140 --> 00:05:39.060
So lazy.

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:40.720
S-Sorry.

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:42.060
I was in a hurry.

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:45.770
Don't be sloppy in front of our guests.

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:49.480
There, all set.

00:05:49.480 --> 00:05:52.630
You're such a kind and lovely girl.

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:57.280
I-I'm not kind.

00:05:57.280 --> 00:05:58.990
Anyone would do that.

00:05:58.990 --> 00:05:59.800
Wow!

00:06:00.140 --> 00:06:03.580
So that's the kind of modesty that 
makes you such a classy Japanese lady!

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:04.370
I get it!

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:05.750
No, you don't!

00:06:05.750 --> 00:06:08.200
B-Be careful from now on.

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:08.940
Okay.

00:06:08.940 --> 00:06:11.960
I'm going to do some yard work.

00:06:21.890 --> 00:06:23.890
I hate your sparkling eyes!

00:06:23.890 --> 00:06:25.590
You don't get anything I said!

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:28.160
How pretty is the world in your eyes?

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:29.400
Learn to be skeptical of people!

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:31.860
You're going to get duped someday, 
and you'll be sorry!

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:38.000
D-Don't get the wrong idea... I was...

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.250
Shh.

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:42.990
I found her!

00:06:42.990 --> 00:06:45.480
I found Sakura-chan!

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:46.760
You found me.

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:49.190
You're "it" next!

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:53.910
One, two, three...

00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:52.340
Quick, hide!

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:56.180
four, five, six, seven...

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:04.660
I'm out of sake, Okami.

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:07.860
I'm sorry. We're preparing some now.

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:09.330
Sake, please.

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:10.600
Right away.

00:07:10.600 --> 00:07:12.720
Oh? Are you a newcomer?

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:14.360
Yes. My name is Yuzu.

00:07:15.050 --> 00:07:16.130
You're adorable.

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:17.330
Pardon me.

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:20.740
You there, cutie. Pour me some sake, too.

00:07:20.740 --> 00:07:23.790
I-I'm in charge of waiting.

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:26.250
I've had enough to eat.

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:29.750
You're such a cutie.

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:33.640
I'll pour the sake.

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:35.460
Go make some hot sake, Ren.

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:36.690
Okay.

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:39.380
Excuse me.

00:07:46.220 --> 00:07:47.120
Ren!

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:49.670
R-Ren-chan!

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:51.150
No! Let me go!

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:54.610
<i>Oh, no! What have I done to a guest?</i>

00:07:54.610 --> 00:07:56.380
How dare you—

00:07:57.310 --> 00:08:03.580
Sir, we can't have you thinking 
Konohanatei is some brothel.

00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:06.250
You seem to be a lightweight.

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:09.200
We'll prepare a car for you.

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:11.430
Please rest at home for tonight.

00:08:13.780 --> 00:08:15.610
What's the matter with this place?!

00:08:15.610 --> 00:08:17.740
How dare you treat a guest like that?

00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:20.220
Okami, tell her!

00:08:20.440 --> 00:08:23.270
Natsume there is right.

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:26.190
Either you return home by yourself,

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:31.610
or I bar your entire party from 
ever returning to Konohanatei.

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:33.680
Please choose.

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:35.430
Ban us?

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:37.200
No way!

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:41.070
One guest is leaving.

00:08:50.540 --> 00:08:55.140
No matter how much I dislike men, 
I shouldn't have done that to a guest.

00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:56.900
Don't let it get to you.

00:08:56.900 --> 00:08:58.850
He was the one in the wrong.

00:09:00.090 --> 00:09:05.200
N-Newcomer Yuzu would humbly 
like to dance for you.

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:08.610
Hey, I like your energy.

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:11.340
All right, I'll dance, too.

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:15.570
Now, then, let's set the mood straight.

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:22.300
What about you?

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:25.710
Th-That's not a job for an attendant.

00:09:26.430 --> 00:09:28.970
Just do whatever you're able to do.

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:34.670
The girls are helping you out 
because you work hard all the time.

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:38.910
No one would need friends 
if we were all equally capable.

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:42.800
Now, then, I think I'll pour some sake.

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:11.780
There, there.

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:12.890
Don't be scared.

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:15.080
It's okay. It's okay.

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:26.560
You're okay now.

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:28.510
Th-Thanks.

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:30.560
You surprised me.

00:10:31.410 --> 00:10:34.550
When I first saw you, 
I thought you were a water fairy.

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:37.760
I've never seen such a beautiful girl.

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:45.310
<i>Since you'd already said 
those words, I couldn't.</i>

00:10:46.010 --> 00:10:51.020
<i>Because I learned that as long as I was 
beautiful, you would look at me.</i>

00:10:53.640 --> 00:10:55.370
Thanks for everything today.

00:10:55.730 --> 00:10:58.140
<i>I have to thank Yuzu-chan, too.</i>

00:10:58.500 --> 00:11:03.840
<i>And I have to send off today's 
guests with my whole heart.</i>

00:11:05.130 --> 00:11:08.040
<i>And I have to thank 
Okami and everyone else,</i>

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:10.110
<i>and wake up earlier than usual,</i>

00:11:10.110 --> 00:11:12.090
<i>and clean better than usual...</i>

00:11:13.870 --> 00:11:20.620
<i>And I hope I'll be even 
more beautiful tomorrow.</i>

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:29.490
No way! Absolutely not!

00:11:29.800 --> 00:11:33.470
We'd be watching naked men 
grapple with each other.

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:35.870
Just hearing about it makes me shudder.

00:11:35.870 --> 00:11:38.040
That's prejudiced.

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:39.830
What are you talking about?

00:11:39.830 --> 00:11:40.730
Satsuki!

00:11:41.120 --> 00:11:43.330
Want to go watch sumo tomorrow?

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:45.370
No way.

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:48.810
Why should I have to see 
your face on my day off?

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:50.190
Ouch...

00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:52.300
Come on, we don't do this all the time.

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:55.080
<i>I guess I don't have to worry 
about anything happening</i>

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:57.350
<i>between Satsuki-neesama and Nacchan.</i>

00:11:58.230 --> 00:12:02.050
<i>I wouldn't mind going shopping with her...</i>

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:04.700
Ren, we have guests.

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.020
Coming.

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:10.460
My name is Ren. I'll be taking 
care of you during your stay.

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:13.920
It's been such a long time since 
we had a hot spring treatment.

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:17.690
Yes, it must be at least a hundred years.

00:12:16.440 --> 00:12:18.140
<i>What a cute couple.</i>

00:12:18.740 --> 00:12:20.930
Is that your grandchild over there?

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:23.330
Yes, that's Aoi.

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:25.380
Our great-great grandchild.

00:12:25.380 --> 00:12:28.840
No, dear, our great-great-great grandchild.

00:12:28.840 --> 00:12:30.960
Such a good child.

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:34.620
Aoi came along to keep us company.

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:36.270
I'll call her over.

00:12:47.790 --> 00:12:51.910
Grandmother, I'd like for 
her to be assigned to me.

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:54.380
Oh, shoot!

00:12:54.980 --> 00:12:57.380
What a beautiful view.

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:58.550
It certainly is.

00:12:58.550 --> 00:12:59.870
I'm so glad we came.

00:12:59.870 --> 00:13:04.310
<i>I'd let my guard down, since Konohanatei 
mostly gets older guests.</i>

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:08.290
<i>Nacchan would change her mind in no time, 
if such a cute girl got to like her.</i>

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:10.900
You'll be bigger in no time, Aoi-chan.

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:11.640
<i>What?</i>

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:13.720
<i>And what are you going 
to do when she's bigger?</i>

00:13:14.610 --> 00:13:17.760
S-Sounds like you're having fun. 
What are you talking about?

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:22.240
<i>You're not even going to talk to me?</i>

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:25.920
Oh, by the way, Nacchan, 
I saw you fighting in the yard.

00:13:25.920 --> 00:13:27.880
We weren't fighting. 
We were sumo wrestling.

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:29.710
That's not the point.

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:33.030
What if you had injured a guest?

00:13:33.030 --> 00:13:35.170
You're so rough.

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:38.670
Natsume-san is so strong 
and awesome, though.

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:39.610
Huh?

00:13:39.940 --> 00:13:42.930
You threw that huge opponent 
like it was nothing.

00:13:42.930 --> 00:13:45.010
I admire you.

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:47.230
Aw, stop. You'll make me blush.

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:50.610
By the way, Ren, tomorrow...

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:53.210
Did she not hear me?

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:58.620
Natsume-san, would you please 
come to town with me tomorrow?

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:01.790
Sure. I have the day off.

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:03.530
<i>Going out?</i>

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:05.150
<i>Just the two of them?</i>

00:14:08.300 --> 00:14:09.570
Kiri-neesama!

00:14:09.890 --> 00:14:13.840
No work is getting done with 
Nacchan assigned to that guest.

00:14:13.840 --> 00:14:14.790
Your work?

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:15.990
Nacchan's work!

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:18.250
But you know...

00:14:18.880 --> 00:14:23.430
It would be boring for such a young girl 
to be in the bath with such an old couple.

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:25.920
I know, but...

00:14:26.180 --> 00:14:29.120
That's not what you're 
really worried about, is it?

00:14:29.120 --> 00:14:31.590
You should be a little more honest.

00:14:33.170 --> 00:14:35.810
Okay, I'll show Aoi-chan around town.

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:39.020
See you, Grandfather, Grandmother.

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:42.220
Don't give her any trouble, now.

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:44.180
See you, Ren.

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:57.810
<i>I'm such an awful girl.</i>

00:14:59.510 --> 00:15:01.440
Hey, Ren-chan.

00:15:03.330 --> 00:15:05.760
You seem kind of down.

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:09.180
Wh-Who are you talking about?

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:14.040
Please talk to me if there's 
anything bothering you.

00:15:16.510 --> 00:15:20.210
<i>There's no point in talking 
to Yuzu-chan about it, but...</i>

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:25.660
This is about my friend.

00:15:25.660 --> 00:15:28.100
Your friend?

00:15:29.050 --> 00:15:32.510
My friend has a friend she's been 
really close to since they were little.

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:37.420
But this girl came along 
who adores the friend.

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:41.850
They talk together, 
and they go out together.

00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:46.280
But don't you think it's pointless 
to get jealous over that?

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:51.570
I scolded her and told her that 
she shouldn't resent the other girl.

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:57.570
Are you sure your friend resents her?

00:15:57.930 --> 00:16:00.090
Do you think she might really be sad?

00:16:04.340 --> 00:16:09.170
I-I have a steamed bun here 
that I've been saving.

00:16:10.810 --> 00:16:13.770
It's my last one, and I was 
looking forward to eating it.

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:18.090
But what if someone took it?

00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:20.650
You're awful!

00:16:20.650 --> 00:16:22.710
Even I would get upset.

00:16:20.650 --> 00:16:23.410
Delicious steamed bun...

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:27.890
But it's not that I'm angry 
at the person who ate it.

00:16:27.890 --> 00:16:30.220
It's that I wanted to eat the steamed bun.

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:33.990
I'd be sad and disappointed 
that I couldn't have it.

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:36.850
Sad and disappointed?

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:43.060
Yes, so instead of scolding your 
friend for resenting another person,

00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:49.360
maybe it's better to console her,
so she won't feel so sad.

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:53.490
R-Ren-chan?!

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:56.310
I'm sorry!

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:59.590
Should I not have said that?

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:02.500
You're so frustrating.

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:04.960
Why are you apologizing?

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:08.760
Still, thanks.

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:13.940
<i>She sure is weird.</i>

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:20.400
You could tell your friend to express her 
true feelings, and not bottle them up.

00:17:21.280 --> 00:17:23.310
True feelings?

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:29.930
You know, that she's sad, and that 
she wants her attention, too.

00:17:30.390 --> 00:17:32.490
D-D-Don't be crazy!

00:17:32.490 --> 00:17:35.000
That would come across as really annoying!

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:38.440
Nacchan would never think that's annoyi—

00:17:45.360 --> 00:17:47.330
I-I'm sorry.

00:17:48.560 --> 00:17:50.280
<i>I should have known.</i>

00:17:51.940 --> 00:17:54.880
<i>My true feelings, huh?</i>

00:17:59.630 --> 00:18:02.480
Nacchan's already back.

00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:07.850
Pardon me.

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:10.200
That's good... Harder...

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:11.440
Welcome h—

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:11.920
L-Like this?

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:25.760
No!

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:29.250
She's mine! Don't touch her!

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:39.050
<i>H-He's a boy?!</i>

00:18:39.920 --> 00:18:41.500
Don't look!

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:44.110
Ren, you know peeping is bad.

00:18:44.110 --> 00:18:46.220
This is <i>my</i> fault?!

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:48.540
What?

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:49.930
What's going on?

00:18:50.370 --> 00:18:54.130
Aoi-chan's dream is to become 
a sumo wrestler someday.

00:18:54.510 --> 00:18:57.100
I'd half given up,

00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:00.720
but when I saw Natsume-san,

00:19:00.720 --> 00:19:04.340
I realized that even someone as 
skinny as I am could become one.

00:19:05.430 --> 00:19:08.510
Natsume-san is my ideal big brother.

00:19:10.410 --> 00:19:14.420
So please, Natsume-niisan, teach me.

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:16.100
H-Hang on.

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:18.810
There are several questions I'd like to ask...

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:23.130
But Nacchan is a girl.

00:19:25.320 --> 00:19:27.280
What?!

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:29.560
I'm no professional myself,

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:34.470
so I took him to town, where we could 
talk to a real sumo wrestler.

00:19:35.680 --> 00:19:36.950
Oh, that's all?

00:19:37.890 --> 00:19:39.470
S-Sorry.

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:43.430
I've never really talked to women before.

00:19:43.430 --> 00:19:46.370
<i>So he wasn't really ignoring me.</i>

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:48.160
<i>So that's it.</i>

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:50.900
<i>The whole thing was just 
me getting ahead of myself.</i>

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:51.570
Oh, yeah.

00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:54.190
I got you a gift.

00:19:54.190 --> 00:19:56.040
It's the comb you were wanting.

00:19:56.370 --> 00:20:01.370
I asked you yesterday if you wanted me to 
get it, but I guess you couldn't hear me.

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:04.340
Sorry.

00:20:11.760 --> 00:20:13.230
Thanks.

00:20:15.860 --> 00:20:17.620
You finally smiled.

00:20:18.850 --> 00:20:21.310
You've been moody since yesterday.

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:26.120
You wouldn't look me in the eye this 
morning when we were leaving, either.

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:30.460
I'm sorry.

00:20:30.460 --> 00:20:34.990
I mean, I know you don't like hearing 
about sumo wrestling, but...

00:20:36.260 --> 00:20:39.950
It was sad not being able 
to see your face, you know.

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:44.170
<i>You could tell your friend 
to express her true feelings.</i>

00:20:45.280 --> 00:20:46.130
Yeah.

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:50.050
I was sad, too.

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:52.950
Really?

00:20:52.950 --> 00:20:54.010
We're the same, then.

00:20:54.010 --> 00:20:55.120
Yeah.

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:04.140
Later.

00:21:04.140 --> 00:21:06.090
I'm going to take a bath.

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:11.660
<b>Konohanatei</b>

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:14.580
Honestly... You're greeting a guest!

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:15.860
S-Sorry.

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:18.830
I'm pretty sure they wouldn't care.

00:21:18.830 --> 00:21:19.850
Nope.

00:21:19.850 --> 00:21:21.660
A girl must be beautiful.

00:21:22.020 --> 00:21:23.460
Sure, whatever.

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:25.320
Hey, um...

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:28.300
Thanks for everything today.

00:21:28.920 --> 00:21:29.810
Huh?

00:21:30.130 --> 00:21:31.580
Nothing.

00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:33.700
Come on, face front.

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:35.860
Idiot.

00:21:36.220 --> 00:21:37.650
Sorry.

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:39.430
Huh? Aoi-chan?

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:43.850
Ren-san is really pretty.

00:21:43.850 --> 00:21:47.090
Once you talk to her, she's very 
good-natured, and she's kind.

00:21:47.550 --> 00:21:49.220
I'm a bit...

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:50.310
Nope.

00:21:50.310 --> 00:21:51.270
Nope...

00:21:52.730 --> 00:21:54.000
Not Ren.

00:21:54.280 --> 00:21:55.790
Why not?

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:58.440
Is she in a relationship 
with someone already?

00:21:58.730 --> 00:22:00.400
Because I said so.

00:22:00.980 --> 00:22:03.850
No means no.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Next Episode 
Raft Bridge of Dreams</b>
